---
---

<div class="bg-surface-container-low border border-surface-container-high rounded-xl p-space-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-md">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-space-md">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-sm">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[28px]">event_available</span>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-0.5">
            <p class="font-callout text-callout font-semibold text-on-surface m-0">
                Sinkronkan rencana cuti ke kalendermu
            </p>
            <p class="font-footnote text-footnote text-on-surface-variant m-0">
                Semua tanggal cuti pada rekomendasi di atas, sekali klik.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 w-full sm:w-auto shrink-0" data-sync-actions>
        <button class="flex-1 sm:flex-initial inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-outline-variant text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors font-callout text-callout font-medium cursor-pointer" type="button" data-export="ics">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">file_download</span>
            <span>Unduh .ics</span>
        </button>
        <button class="flex-1 sm:flex-initial inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary hover:opacity-90 transition-all font-callout text-callout font-semibold cursor-pointer" type="button" data-export="gcal">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">calendar_add_on</span>
            <span>Google Calendar</span>
        </button>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="fixed bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 px-5 py-3 rounded-full bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface font-caption-1 text-caption-1 font-medium shadow-xl opacity-0 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 z-50" id="toast">
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary-fixed">check_circle</span>
    <span id="toast-message">Tersimpan ke rencana kalender.</span>
</div>
